    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Four children can ride the Deluxe Multi See Saw at once, two at each end, on Knight Blue seats. That doubles the number of children a single see saw can keep busy, which matters on a school ground at break time or a society garden in the evening. It suits the 3 to 9 years Key User Group. Children at the same end learn to push together, which adds a teamwork element to a familiar ride. The see saw measures 9'8\" x 2'3\", with a safe play area of 13'8\" x 6'3\". Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe and roto-moulded parts, and bearings carry a 1-year warranty. Send us your site size and we will mark it on a layout drawing."
     }
    ]
   }
